{"articleNo":"302876","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=302876&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] [3D프린팅융합기술센터] 2021년 여성정책개발원 3D프린팅 및 코딩 전문인력 양성과정 모집 연장 공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.03.11","hit":"9317","attachments":[{"name":"2021년도+경북여성정책개발원+여성일자리본부+산학연계+교육과정+참가신청서+양식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=302876&attachNo=98401"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&lt; 2021년 여성정책개발원 3D프린팅 및 코딩 전문인력 양성과정 모집&gt;</span></b><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-align: start; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">“3D</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-align: start; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">프린팅지도사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-align: start; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">”&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-align: start; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">자격증을 취득하여 방과후강사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-align: start; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-align: start; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">자유학기제 강사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-align: start; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-align: start; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">진로직업체험기관 강사 등으로 취창업 활동을 지원하기 위한&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-align: start; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">전문인력 양성과정의 교육생을 아래와 같이 모집합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-align: start; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">.</span><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-align: start; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt;\">◉&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: HY헤드라인M; font-size: 11pt;\">교육대상</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">주민등록상 경북 도내에 주소를 둔 여성 중&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">취창업 의사가 분명하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">교육에 적극적으로 참여하고자 하는&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">여성&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">20</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">선발</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt;\">∙&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt;\">교육생 선발 시 현재 취업중</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt;\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt;\">고용보험 가입</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt;\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt;\">이거나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt;\">본인명의 사업자 등록 보유자는 교육대상에 해당 안됨</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">∙&nbsp;</span>취약계층 여성은 정원의&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">20%&nbsp;</span>범위 내에서 우선 선발가능<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span>관련 서류 제출 시<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">방통대</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">야간대 재학생</span>은 재학증명서 제출 시 참여가능<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span>야간수업 명기<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-style: italic;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-style: italic;\">금오공대&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-style: italic;\">4</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-style: italic;\">학년&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-style: italic;\">2</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-style: italic;\">학기차 여학생들의 많은 참여바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-style: italic;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-style: italic;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt;\">◉&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: HY헤드라인M; font-size: 11pt;\">신청방법</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">∙&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">제출서류&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">신청서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">첨부파일 다운로드</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">∙&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">제출방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">택</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">이메일&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: jjini06@kumoh.ac.kr</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">방문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">우편&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">경북 구미시 대학로&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">61,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">금오공과대학교 디지털관 413</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">호</span><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmEYHoQFkhjA0gMQA4CEBaAzAMvAJ2QHEBnXYgCQCMiBbAOgCtUBzIA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
